# Simple and folded binary E8 matrices

The twelve signed simple-root tables are in the same integral Geck coordinate
order as the folded word certificates. Four checked products realize the two
paired diagram orbits. At the fixed nodes 2 and 3, the checked involution braid
and the distinction of positive and negative roots detect noncentral images
in the literal twisted central quotient.

Source: GLS3 §§1.12, 2.4 and 2.6; Aschbacher–Smith A.2.18, p.40.
